<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Situs Sedang Dalam Perbaikan</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        
        body {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            color: #333;
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        
        .container {
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 600px;
            width: 100%;
            background-color: white;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }
        
        .icon-container {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            position: relative;
        }
        
        .main-icon {
            font-size: 80px;
            color: #e67e22;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            animation: bounce 2s infinite ease-in-out;
        }
        
        @keyframes bounce {
            0%, 100% {
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
            50% {
                transform: translateY(-10px);
            }
        }
        
        .small-icon {
            position: absolute;
            font-size: 24px;
            color: #3498db;
        }
        
        .icon-1 {
            top: 10px;
            left: 25%;
            animation: float 3s infinite ease-in-out;
        }
        
        .icon-2 {
            top: 20px;
            right: 25%;
            animation: float 3s infinite ease-in-out 0.5s;
        }
        
        .icon-3 {
            bottom: 10px;
            left: 30%;
            animation: float 3s infinite ease-in-out 1s;
        }
        
        .icon-4 {
            bottom: 20px;
            right: 30%;
            animation: float 3s infinite ease-in-out 1.5s;
        }
        
        @keyframes float {
            0%, 100% {
                transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg);
            }
            50% {
                transform: translateY(-8px) rotate(10deg);
            }
        }
        
        h1 {
            color: #2c3e50;
            font-size: 28px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        
        p {
            color: #555;
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        
        .progress-container {
            width: 100%;
            height: 8px;
            background-color: #ecf0f1;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin-top: 30px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        .progress-bar {
            height: 100%;
            width: 60%;
            background-color: #3498db;
            border-radius: 4px;
            animation: loading 3s infinite ease-in-out;
        }
        
        @keyframes loading {
            0%, 100% {
                width: 60%;
            }
            50% {
                width: 80%;
            }
        }
        
        .pulse {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 12px;
            height: 12px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background-color: #e74c3c;
            margin: 0 5px;
            animation: pulse 1.5s infinite;
        }
        
        .pulse:nth-child(2) {
            animation-delay: 0.2s;
            background-color: #f39c12;
        }
        
        .pulse:nth-child(3) {
            animation-delay: 0.4s;
            background-color: #2ecc71;
        }
        
        @keyframes pulse {
            0%, 100% {
                transform: scale(1);
                opacity: 1;
            }
            50% {
                transform: scale(1.5);
                opacity: 0.7;
            }
        }
        
        .footer {
            margin-top: 40px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #7f8c8d;
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .container {
                padding: 30px 20px;
            }
            
            h1 {
                font-size: 24px;
            }
            
            p {
                font-size: 16px;
            }
            
            .main-icon {
                font-size: 60px;
            }
            
            .small-icon {
                font-size: 18px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="icon-container">
            <i class="fas fa-tools main-icon"></i>
            <i class="fas fa-cog small-icon icon-1"></i>
            <i class="fas fa-screwdriver small-icon icon-2"></i>
            <i class="fas fa-wrench small-icon icon-3"></i>
            <i class="fas fa-hammer small-icon icon-4"></i>
        </div>
        
        <h1>Situs Sedang Dalam Perbaikan</h1>
        
        <p>Website ini saat ini tidak tersedia karena sedang dilakukan pemeliharaan dan perbaikan teknis.</p>
        
        <div class="progress-container">
            <div class="progress-bar"></div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <span class="pulse"></span>
            <span class="pulse"></span>
            <span class="pulse"></span>
            <br><br>
            Mohon kembali lagi nanti
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>